to charge customer for amount
    given customer is a CustomerId
    given amount is a positive Money
    produces a Receipt
    fails with Declined
    uses payments
    expect amount ≤ limit of customer because "limits are enforced upstream"
    ensure if it succeeds, total_charged_to customer = total_charged_to customer at entry + amount
    ensure if it fails, total_charged_to customer = total_charged_to customer at entry
    ensure "the customer is charged at most once" because "payments are idempotent"
    changes only balance of customer
    example charge alice for 10 is receipt_for 10
    idempotent by customer, amount
    assumes "the card network answers within 30 seconds"
